OL,3,GNEWSAWater 'slowly returning' after
OL,4,Asupplies cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in two East Sussex villages
OL,7,Fwho woke up to no running water are
OL,8,Fseeing that supplies are "slowly
OL,9,Freturning", a water company says.
OL,11,FProperties in East Hoathly and Halland
OL,12,Fexperienced no water or low pressure
OL,13,Ffrom about 23:30 GMT on Wednesday,
OL,14,Faccording to South East Water.
OL,16,FAt about 08:40 on Thursday, the company
OL,17,Fsaid: "The investigations are now
OL,18,Fcomplete and we are slowly returning
OL,19,Fthe water to the pipework."
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
